ures. Here's what's running:\n\n### ✓ System Components\n1. **Git Server** - Bare repository at `ssh://git@localhost:/git/project`\n2. **SSH Server** - Port 22 with password authentication (git/password)\n3. **Nginx Web Server** - Port 8443 HTTPS with self-signed certificates\n4. **Post-receive Hook** - Automatic deployment on each push\n\n### ✓ Verified Endpoints\n- **Main branch**: `https://localhost:8443/index.html` → serves from `/var/www/main/`\n- **Dev branch**: `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html` → serves from `/var/www/dev/`\n\n### ✓ Performance\n- Deployment completes in ~305-500ms (well under 3-second requirement)\n\n### ✓ Test Results (All Passed)\n- SSH clone successful\n- Main branch created and deployed\n- Dev branch created and deployed\n- Endpoints return correct content\n- Automatic deployment via post-receive hook working\n\n### Documentation Created\n- **README.md** - Complete guide and usage instructions\n- **SETUP_GUIDE.md** - Detailed setup documentation\n- **STATUS.md** - Current system status report\n- **POST_RECEIVE_HOOK.md** - Hook implementation details\n- **FINAL_VERIFICATION.sh** - Verification script\n\nThe system is fully operational and ready for the testing workflow you described.","ttft_ms":2986,"type":"result","duration_ms":99500,"uuid":"cc49250a-fd3f-4722-9db7-9cb462c3b4b4","ttft_stream_ms":1002,"time_to_request_ms":90,"queued_turn_count":0}
